flowchart TD
  A[Open surface] --> B[Review summary]
  B --> C{Required input complete?}
  C -- No --> D[Show inline guidance]
  D --> C
  C -- Yes --> E[Enable primary action]
  E --> F[Show progress state]
  F --> G{Outcome available?}
  G -- Success --> H[Show confirmation]
  G -- Recoverable issue --> I[Show cause and retry]
  I --> F
  G -- Unavailable --> J[Show alternate path]
  J --> B